 `runuser -u gha-runner`, the environment variables like `HOME`, `USER`, and `LOGNAME` are not automatically updated and will still point to `/root` (since the systemd service runs as root). Because the runner process runs as `gha-runner`, it does not have write access to `/root`, which will cause any workflow steps or tools trying to write to `$HOME` (e.g., `.npm`, `.cache`, etc.) to fail with a `Permission denied` error.\n\nExplicitly set these environment variables using `env` before executing `run.sh` to ensure a clean and writable user environment.\n\n```suggestion\nexec /usr/sbin/runuser -u gha-runner -- \\\n  env HOME=/home/gha-runner USER=gha-runner LOGNAME=gha-runner \\\n  /opt/actions-runner/run.sh --jitconfig \"${jit_config}\"\n```","created_at":"2026-07-16T04:46:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T04:46:30Z","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1586#discussion_r3592700289","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1586","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments/3592700289"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1586#discussion_r3592700289"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1586"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments/3592700289/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":39,"original_start_line":39,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":40,"original_line":40,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":6,"position":6,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments/3592700294","pull_request_review_id":4710517759,"id":3592700294,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOO5D6p87WJEGG","diff_hunk":"@@ -97,6 +97,7 @@ if (errors.length === 0) {\n   const updateControllerLifecycle = read('scripts/infra/windows