e read using `read()`, but they are not declared in the `requiredFiles` array at the top of this file.\n\nIf any of these files are missing, the validation script will crash with an unhandled `ENOENT` exception instead of failing gracefully with a validation error. Please add these files to the `requiredFiles` array to ensure the validation fails closed and reports a clean error list.\n\n<details>\n<summary>References</summary>\n\n1. Ensure validation and check scripts handle missing or malformed critical artifacts gracefully without throwing unhandled exceptions. They should fail-closed by returning a failed validation status, a failure count, and diagnostic codes, backed by regression tests.\n2. In validation scripts, convert source-artifact path, read, or shape problems into stable validator warning/failure metadata instead of throwing raw parser or load failures, and keep strictly required dependencies as explicit required arguments.\n</details>","created_at":"2026-07-16T04:46:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T04:46:30Z","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1586#discussion_r3592700294","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1586","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments/3592700294"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1586#discussion_r3592700294"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1586"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments/3592700294/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":100,"original_line":100,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments/3592705