 service starts under `ProtectSystem=strict`, this new entrypoint still needs write access to the runner root: the official v2.335.1 `run.sh` copies `run-helper.sh.template` to `$DIR/run-helper.sh` before launching the listener. The service only grants `ReadWritePaths` for `_diag`, `_work`, `/home/gha-runner`, and `/run/cie-jit`, so on this golden image the copy into `/opt/actions-runner/run-helper.sh` is denied and the JIT runner exits before connecting. Please either permit that exact helper path or pre-create/update it in a writable way before switching to `run.sh`.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.","created_at":"2026-07-16T04:48:02Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T04:48:02Z","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1586#discussion_r3592705397","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1586","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments/3592705397"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1586#discussion_r3592705397"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1586"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments/3592705397/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":40,"original_line":40,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":6,"position":6,"subject_type":"line"}]